{"id":"MOEX-113020-2301-Q096","title":"原位乳癌的邊界：肌上皮、基底膜與浸潤","version":"accepted","batch":"113-1-med2","sourceSha256":"16e4f76cbb872d47980409484debe0783401c7e65a55f338ff642c46e3a13110","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_5a01acfb690c8191b3796bc453f98a37","sourceAnchor":"q96","shortHtml":"<p>答案是<strong>A，完整肌上皮層</strong>。原位乳癌的惡性上皮細胞仍侷限在原有乳管／小葉結構內，尚未穿越基底膜浸入間質；周圍保留的<strong>肌上皮層</strong>是區分原位與浸潤病灶的重要病理證據。良性乳管也有肌上皮，因此<strong>保留肌上皮不等於單獨證明是癌</strong>，還需先確認內部細胞與架構符合癌的形態。</p>","html":"<div><h2>原位乳癌的邊界：肌上皮、基底膜與浸潤</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：A</p><h3>原位與浸潤，關鍵是癌細胞是否越過原有邊界</h3>\n<p>答案是<strong>A，完整肌上皮層</strong>。原位乳癌的惡性上皮細胞仍侷限在原有乳管／小葉結構內，尚未穿越基底膜浸入間質；周圍保留的<strong>肌上皮層</strong>是區分原位與浸潤病灶的重要病理證據。良性乳管也有肌上皮，因此<strong>保留肌上皮不等於單獨證明是癌</strong>，還需先確認內部細胞與架構符合癌的形態。</p>\n<h3>先看空間：乳管內、肌上皮、基底膜、間質</h3>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:600px;--reviewed-image-ratio:2.575107296137339\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/f28689388a2c48adba6a166b9ef17b5e772815f0637acc6d34c99febef4614f8.jpg\" alt=\"正常乳管、原位乳管癌、浸潤乳管癌與進展癌比較，肌上皮及基底膜在原位仍包圍上皮\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"233\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/f28689388a2c48adba6a166b9ef17b5e772815f0637acc6d34c99febef4614f8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>由左至右為正常乳房、<strong>原位乳管癌（DCIS）</strong>、浸潤乳管癌與進展癌。橘色為上皮細胞，藍色為肌上皮，淡藍細線為基底膜；原位階段細胞仍被外圍層次包住，浸潤後向間質散出。後兩格是進展機轉示意，不表示每個DCIS都會如此演變。圖：<a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3296264/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Khamis等，Figure 1</a>；<a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3296264/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY（來源未標版本）</a>，完整原圖。</figcaption></figure>\n<p>免疫染色須結合形態、內部陽性對照與適當的多種標記。肌上皮染色可稀疏或局部減弱；p63也可能染到特定分化的腫瘤細胞，故不能把「任意位置有棕色」或「某一處沒染到」直接當成原位／浸潤的唯一結論。</p>\n<h3>再看染色：找的是病灶「外圍」的肌上皮</h3>\n<div>\n<div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:720px;--reviewed-image-ratio:2.608695652173913\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/4ffb3334b3b5e81825324cb856959b65f0f0f254944f16bef63cfe9a8c489a6c.jpg\" alt=\"原位乳管癌A p63核染色與B平滑肌肌凝蛋白細胞質染色顯示周邊肌上皮\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"276\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/4ffb3334b3b5e81825324cb856959b65f0f0f254944f16bef63cfe9a8c489a6c.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption><strong>原位病例：</strong>A的p63在周邊肌上皮細胞核呈棕色點狀染色；B的平滑肌肌凝蛋白（SMMS-1）呈較連續的細胞質輪廓。圖：<a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6873275/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Komforti與Harmon，Fig. 5，doi:10.1177/2374289519888727</a>。</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:660px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.3387423935091278\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/90c917ef16930a9a7a96d90a680a045d143f25f4d95fff785fb5ac4a94a90489.jpg\" alt=\"浸潤癌病例p63染色，頂部正常導管周圍棕色陽性作內對照，其他浸潤腺體缺少外圍陽性層\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"660\" height=\"493\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/90c917ef16930a9a7a96d90a680a045d143f25f4d95fff785fb5ac4a94a90489.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption><strong>浸潤病例：</strong>上方正常導管外周棕色p63陽性可作內對照，其他不規則浸潤腺體缺乏相應肌上皮層。圖：<a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6974746/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scholl與Flanagan，Fig. 3，doi:10.1177/2374289519897390</a>。本組兩圖均<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a>，非商業學習、完整原樣呈現。</figcaption></figure></div>\n</div>\n<h3>肌上皮與基底膜，彼此相鄰但不是同一層</h3>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>層次／檢查</th><th>主要角色</th><th>判讀重點</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td><strong>肌上皮層</strong></td><td>位於乳管上皮外側的細胞層</td><td>p63看細胞核；平滑肌肌凝蛋白等看細胞質</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>基底膜</strong></td><td>細胞外基質構成的界線</td><td>不是肌上皮細胞本身；原位癌未越過此界線</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>間質</strong></td><td>乳管外的支持組織</td><td>惡性上皮侵入此處，才涉及浸潤判斷</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n<h3>B、C、D都不能取代邊界判斷</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>B　纖維化與纖維母細胞增生：</strong>浸潤癌可有間質反應，但良性硬化病灶亦可纖維化，無法單獨定義原位癌。</li>\n<li><strong>C　沒有淋巴球漿細胞浸潤：</strong>發炎反應多寡並非判定癌細胞是否侵入間質的標準。</li>\n<li><strong>D　雌激素受體（ER）陽性：</strong>主要提供生物學與內分泌治療相關資訊；原位癌和浸潤癌均可能陽性或陰性。</li></ul>\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：113年第一次醫學（二）原題，第96題</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：初始標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3296264/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">乳房腫瘤微環境：正常到浸潤的層次圖</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6873275/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原位乳管癌教學病例：肌上皮免疫染色</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6974746/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">浸潤乳管癌教學病例：p63內對照</a></li><li><a href=\"https://meridian.allenpress.com/aplm/article/135/4/422/461226/Best-Practices-in-Diagnostic-Immunohistochemistry\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">肌上皮免疫標記：判讀限制與最佳實務</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cap.org/cap-guidelines/estrogen-and-progesterone-receptor-testing-in-breast-cancer-guideline-update/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ASCO/CAP：ER檢測在DCIS及浸潤癌的角色</a></li></ul></details></div>","imageCount":3,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：A"}